# Detailed native activity icons and Windows release
Workstream-ID: lea-33
GitHub-Issue: https://github.com/Zanark/LinkedIn-EasyApply-Automaton/issues/33
Publication: PUBLIC_SAFE_PROJECTION
Source-record: Reviewed bounded native action-tile and delivery request
Status: DONE
Milestone: Ship distinctive action artwork, refreshed media and updated source
Dependencies: lea-29, lea-30, lea-31, lea-32

## Purpose
Make every native current-operation stage visually distinct with detailed,
partially filled multicolor artwork. Center the icon and compact rounded action
label without a redundant visible caption; give the frame a steady semantic-color
glow. Deliver refreshed fictional documentation media and a new immutable Windows
release while preserving existing runtime use.

